<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Murphy returns six weeks after his intake visit for post-traumatic stress disorder and chronic insomnia. He has attended five weekly sessions of Cognitive Processing Therapy with Dr. Lee and completes the practice assignments between sessions; Dr. Lee&apos;s consultation report arrived today. His nightmares have fallen from most nights to two or three nights a week. He uses the agreed sleep routine on five to six nights a week and now falls asleep in about 30 minutes instead of more than an hour, although he still wakes once or twice on most nights. He startles less easily and concentrates better at work, and his mood is better. He has had no thoughts of suicide or self-harm since the intake visit. He carries his safety plan, has the 988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline saved in his phone, and reports that the lethal-means steps agreed at intake remain in place. He drinks no alcohol, uses no cannabis or other drugs, and takes no medicines or sleep aids. No one has noticed loud snoring or pauses in his breathing, and he is not sleepy during the day. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Fewer nightmares, quicker sleep onset, better concentration and mood</td></tr><tr><td>Nightmares</td><td>Two or three nights a week, down from most nights</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>Asleep in about 30 minutes; wakes once or twice most nights; routine used five to six nights a week</td></tr><tr><td>Treatment engagement</td><td>Five Cognitive Processing Therapy sessions; practice assignments completed</td></tr><tr><td>Safety</td><td>No suicidal thoughts, intent, or plan since intake; safety plan in use</td></tr><tr><td>Substances</td><td>No alcohol, cannabis, other drugs, or sleep aids</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

